{"seq":2,"slug":"public-goods-cooperation","title":"公共品与合作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/experimental-economics/games-markets/public-goods-cooperation","wordCount":1725,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"公共品与合作\">公共品与合作</h1><p>把四个陌生人放进同一间实验室，给每人 20 块钱，告诉他们：投进公共账户的钱会被加倍后平分给所有人。理性自利的算盘很清楚——不管别人投不投，自己留着不投永远更划算，因为投进去的每一块只能拿回半块。可如果人人都这么算，谁都不投，结果是集体最差。这就是公共品博弈，它把人类面临的最古老困境——从摊税到减排——压缩进了一张实验桌。而实验给出的答案，比纯理论预测的「全员搭便车」要复杂、也温暖得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>公共品博弈是研究集体行动困境的标准范式：个体的私利与集体的最优系统性冲突。本篇专注多人、重复情境下的合作动态——合作如何随轮次衰减、惩罚与制度如何挽救它、条件合作者如何存在。双人范式下的偏好建模（不平等厌恶、互惠）已在<a href=\"social-preferences-ultimatum-trust\">社会偏好</a>详述，本篇直接调用其结论，聚焦群体层面的涌现与机制设计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[公共品博弈&lt;br/&gt;私利与集体最优冲突] --&gt; B[纳什预测: 全员零贡献]&#10;    A --&gt; C[实际: 初始约半数贡献]&#10;    C --&gt; D[重复博弈中逐轮衰减]&#10;    D --&gt; E{引入机制?}&#10;    E --&gt;|无| F[合作崩溃至接近零]&#10;    E --&gt;|惩罚| G[合作回升并维持]&#10;    E --&gt;|沟通/声誉| H[合作显著提升]&#10;    G --&gt; I[利他性惩罚的代价与作用]\">flowchart TD\n    A[公共品博弈&lt;br/&gt;私利与集体最优冲突] --&gt; B[纳什预测: 全员零贡献]\n    A --&gt; C[实际: 初始约半数贡献]\n    C --&gt; D[重复博弈中逐轮衰减]\n    D --&gt; E{引入机制?}\n    E --&gt;|无| F[合作崩溃至接近零]\n    E --&gt;|惩罚| G[合作回升并维持]\n    E --&gt;|沟通/声誉| H[合作显著提升]\n    G --&gt; I[利他性惩罚的代价与作用]</pre><p>下表对比不同制度安排下的合作结果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>制度安排</th>\n<th>典型贡献水平</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一次性匿名博弈</td>\n<td>约 40-60% 初始禀赋</td>\n<td>社会偏好+误解</td>\n<td>无法维持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无惩罚重复博弈</td>\n<td>逐轮衰减至接近零</td>\n<td>搭便车侵蚀</td>\n<td>合作崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带同伴惩罚</td>\n<td>回升并稳定在高位</td>\n<td>利他性惩罚威慑</td>\n<td>惩罚本身耗费资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>允许事前沟通</td>\n<td>显著提升并维持</td>\n<td>承诺+社会规范激活</td>\n<td>现实中难复制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"合作的衰减之谜\">合作的衰减之谜</h2><p>公共品博弈最稳健的发现，是合作随重复而衰减。第一轮里，被试平均投入约一半禀赋，远高于纳什均衡预测的零——这本身就证明社会偏好在起作用。但若把同一群人匹配着玩十轮,平均贡献会一轮轮下滑，到最后几轮逼近零。为什么?</p>\n<p>早期解释有两派。一派认为这是「学习」:被试逐渐看懂搭便车更划算,于是向纳什均衡收敛。另一派认为这是「失望」:多数人本想合作,但一旦发现总有人搭便车占自己便宜,出于负向互惠（见<a href=\"social-preferences-ultimatum-trust\">社会偏好</a>）便逐步撤回合作以示报复。费希巴赫等人用「条件合作」框架调和了两派——大多数人既非纯自私也非无条件利他，而是<strong>条件合作者</strong>:别人合作我就合作，别人搭便车我也撤。当人群里混入少数纯搭便车者，条件合作者的合作就被一轮轮拖垮，呈现出整体衰减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"利他性惩罚-合作的守护者\">利他性惩罚：合作的守护者</h2><p>如果衰减源于搭便车者侵蚀，那么让合作者能惩罚搭便车者，应当能挽救合作。费尔与盖希特 2000 年的实验正是如此设计:在每轮贡献后,增加一个阶段,允许被试花自己的钱去削减他人的收益。结果戏剧性——一旦引入惩罚,合作不再衰减,反而回升并稳定在高位。</p>\n<p>关键在于,惩罚是<strong>利他性</strong>的:惩罚者自掏腰包,而威慑带来的合作收益却由全体共享。这是一种二阶公共品——为何有人愿意承担惩罚成本?答案again指向负向互惠与对违反规范者的愤怒情绪。利他性惩罚的存在,为人类大规模合作的演化提供了微观机制。不过它也有阴暗面:实验还发现「反社会惩罚」——有些人会去惩罚那些贡献高的合作者(可能出于嫉妒或报复被惩罚),且这种现象在某些文化中更普遍,会侵蚀惩罚的正面效果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[重复公共品博弈] --&gt; B[观察到搭便车]&#10;    B --&gt; C{有惩罚机制?}&#10;    C --&gt;|无| D[条件合作者撤回合作]&#10;    D --&gt; E[合作逐轮崩溃]&#10;    C --&gt;|有| F[合作者花钱惩罚搭便车者]&#10;    F --&gt; G[搭便车者收益受损]&#10;    G --&gt; H[威慑提升后续贡献]&#10;    H --&gt; I[合作回升并维持]&#10;    F --&gt; J[风险: 反社会惩罚&lt;br/&gt;惩罚高贡献者]&#10;    J --&gt; K[侵蚀正面效果]\">graph TD\n    A[重复公共品博弈] --&gt; B[观察到搭便车]\n    B --&gt; C{有惩罚机制?}\n    C --&gt;|无| D[条件合作者撤回合作]\n    D --&gt; E[合作逐轮崩溃]\n    C --&gt;|有| F[合作者花钱惩罚搭便车者]\n    F --&gt; G[搭便车者收益受损]\n    G --&gt; H[威慑提升后续贡献]\n    H --&gt; I[合作回升并维持]\n    F --&gt; J[风险: 反社会惩罚&lt;br/&gt;惩罚高贡献者]\n    J --&gt; K[侵蚀正面效果]</pre><h2 id=\"维系合作的其它制度\">维系合作的其它制度</h2><p>惩罚不是唯一杠杆。一系列实验梳理出多种能撬动合作的制度,每一种都对应现实中的某类治理工具。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>沟通</strong>:哪怕只是事前几分钟的自由交谈,也能显著提升并维持合作——它激活了社会规范、制造了非约束性承诺。这是埃莉诺·奥斯特罗姆(2009 年诺奖)在真实公共池塘资源治理中反复观察到的关键要素。</li>\n<li><strong>声誉</strong>:当贡献历史可被他人看见,人们为维护声誉而合作,间接互惠开始运作。</li>\n<li><strong>群体规模与边际收益</strong>:群体越小、公共账户回报率越高,合作越易维持。</li>\n<li><strong>奖励而非惩罚</strong>:用正向激励奖励合作者,有时与惩罚同样有效且少了破坏性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些制度发现的政策含义极为直接:现实中维系合作往往不是靠改变人性,而是靠设计对的制度环境。这条线索延伸到了真实世界的政策设计,详见<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/behavioral-policy-nudge\">行为政策与助推</a>;而其严谨性又依赖<a href=\"../methodology/experimental-design-control\">实验设计与控制</a>中讨论的重复博弈匹配方式(陌生人 vs 伙伴匹配)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收益结构的形式化\">收益结构的形式化</h2><p>公共品博弈的张力可以用收益函数清楚地看出来。设有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 名参与者,每人禀赋 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>,个体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到公共账户,公共账户总和乘以边际人均回报 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 后平分。个体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的收益为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_i = E - g_i + \\alpha \\sum_{j=1}^{n} g_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0652em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>困境的根源一目了然:对个体而言,只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>,多投一块的私人回报 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 小于成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>,故纳什均衡是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>;但对集体而言,只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\alpha &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>,每多投一块的社会总回报 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 大于成本,故社会最优是全员投满。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 介于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 之间正是「困境」成立的条件——私人激励与社会激励指向相反。实验中合作之所以能部分维持,正说明真人的效用里装着超出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>公共品博弈刻画私利与集体最优的系统冲突,纳什预测全员零贡献,但实际初始贡献约半数。</li>\n<li>重复博弈中合作逐轮衰减,「条件合作者」框架解释了这一现象:少数搭便车者拖垮多数有条件的合作。</li>\n<li>利他性惩罚能挽救合作并使其稳定,但代价是惩罚者自担成本,且存在侵蚀效果的反社会惩罚。</li>\n<li>沟通、声誉、小群体、奖励等制度同样能维系合作,呼应奥斯特罗姆的真实公共资源治理研究。</li>\n<li>收益函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_i = E - g_i + \\alpha\\sum g_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n &lt; \\alpha &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时制造困境;制度设计的政策含义通向<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/behavioral-policy-nudge\">行为政策与助推</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"公共品与合作","id":"公共品与合作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"合作的衰减之谜","id":"合作的衰减之谜"},{"level":2,"text":"利他性惩罚：合作的守护者","id":"利他性惩罚-合作的守护者"},{"level":2,"text":"维系合作的其它制度","id":"维系合作的其它制度"},{"level":2,"text":"收益结构的形式化","id":"收益结构的形式化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"社会偏好（最后通牒·独裁者·信任博弈）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/experimental-economics/games-markets/social-preferences-ultimatum-trust"},"next":{"title":"市场与拍卖实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/experimental-economics/games-markets/market-auction-experiments"}}